    "section": "09. Movement Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "09.06",
    "summary": "An unengaged unit on the battlefield can Advance, following the [Moving](vsdata:core-rule/moving) rules:\n\n1. Roll 1 D6; the unit can move up to that result plus its M.\n2. It must end unengaged.\n\nUnless a rule says otherwise, it may neither charge nor start an action until the turn ends.",
